it e35fb846+dirty and git rev-parse --short HEAD prints e35fb846; cargo clippy --release --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings Finished clean. Known-positive, chosen before the tree was read: the --probe positive fixture (an upward build.rs) is red under check_build_edges. Known-negative: python scripts/modgraph.py --check on the landed tree exits 0."; }
